# Process Management

## List running processes

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ps -ef"
```

## Find a process

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ps -ef | grep nginx"
```

## Kill a process

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "pkill nginx"
```

## Kill process by PID

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "kill -9 1234"
```

## Display top processes

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "top -b -n 1"
```

## Display process tree

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "pstree"
```

## Check Docker processes

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "docker ps"
```

## Check system load

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "uptime"
```

## Check CPU-intensive processes

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "ps -eo pid,ppid,cmd,%mem,%cpu --sort=-%cpu | head"
```

## Check memory-intensive processes

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "ps -eo pid,ppid,cmd,%mem,%cpu --sort=-%mem | head"
```
